{"3680870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Striatum", "steam_appid": 3680870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>oh Noooo...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you overslept for the Party didn't You?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>why are you Always doing things like that?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>how Are you going to get ready in Time?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What are you looking for?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your apartment and a multitude of distractions as you desperately try to get ready for a party in under 10 minutes. Notifications, spam messages, and shiny objects alike will do anything they can to stop you. Find and choose from over 400 items to build the ultimate party inventory. Chat with your friends along the way on your new and smart phone. Find unique events and interactions, complete quests, and discover the many secrets of <strong><i>Striatum</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person point-and-click PC adventure game with a colorful and surreal mid-90s low-poly 3D style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lovingly handcrafted open-apartment environment full of things to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 400 items to find. If you can inspect it, you can collect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 ending scenarios to unlock. See how your actions getting ready impact your party performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly re-playable. Each run takes up to ten minutes. Play again and again to discover new items, ending scenarios, changes to the apartment, and new conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your busy life with your very own smart phone. Chat with your friends, keep track of important tasks, check out your stats, and play games! <i>(Wait, didn't you have something to do?)</i></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>oh Noooo...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you overslept for the Party didn't You?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>why are you Always doing things like that?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>how Are you going to get ready in Time?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What are you looking for?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your apartment and a multitude of distractions as you desperately try to get ready for a party in under 10 minutes. Notifications, spam messages, and shiny objects alike will do anything they can to stop you. Find and choose from over 400 items to build the ultimate party inventory. Chat with your friends along the way on your new and smart phone. Find unique events and interactions, complete quests, and discover the many secrets of <strong><i>Striatum</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person point-and-click PC adventure game with a colorful and surreal mid-90s low-poly 3D style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lovingly handcrafted open-apartment environment full of things to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 400 items to find. If you can inspect it, you can collect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 ending scenarios to unlock. See how your actions getting ready impact your party performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly re-playable. Each run takes up to ten minutes. 